 under the action of $T$ by calculating the matrix product $TX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}TX & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -4 \\\\ -6 & 8\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 5 & -2 \\\\ 2 & -10 & 4\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the image's vertices are $(-1,2)$, $(5,-10),$ $(-2,4).$ Notice that all three points lie on the same line.\n\nSo, the image of our triangle under the action of $T$ is as follows:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14062587/assets/e7bfe2b85983b2cd45dd3e2f9bbfeed0d8440d838ae11fa4afb0b0b1476529ea.png)" 13194139535324 true] [17592186343768 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343769 13194139535324 true] [17592186343768 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343770 13194139535324 true] [17592186343768 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343771 13194139535324 true] [17592186343768 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343772 13194139535324 true] [17592186343768 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343773 13194139535324 true] [17592186343768 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535324 true] [17592186343768 1041 "selection" 13194139535324 true] [17592186343768 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343772 13194139535324 true] [17592186343768 1110 #uuid "0710a7e7-2fa9-5968-9699-25053d9a320b" 13194139535324 true] [17592186343769 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14062587/assets/3b14cd00f6c722d357efc70dd1d7ab68572582a8a916579c575015e2ab52aa3b.png" 13194139535324 true] [17592186343769 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139535324 true] [17592186343769 1111 #uuid "73f93df4-9407-596f-9ffe-6ddd6857f0e9" 13194139535324 true] [17592186343770 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14062587/assets/eb5bd61e6c2cc904992d8122682cf972db323d086fbee37c0321ff7746d75a52.png" 13194139535324 true] [17592186343770 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139535324 true] [17592186343770 1111 #uuid "c82b35